1. 36K - 36Cl mirror assignments partially based on Richter & Brown 2012.
2. Proton widths estimated using experimental C2S values listed in Endt 1990.
3. Gamma-ray partial widths of 36K states estimated from mean lifetimes of bound 36Cl mirror states (ENSDF).
4. Direct capture estimated using C2S values listed in Endt 1990. 
